# Allow-list: the app image's build context is the repository root (infra/compose/apps/Dockerfile),
# and the root holds the venv, local state and results. Add a path here only when the Dockerfile
# copies it. Images built from other contexts (mlflow/) are not affected.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!features
!connectors
!contracts/canonical_tx.avsc
!stream/__init__.py
!stream/settings.py
!stream/connectors
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
